# Build directories
build/
cmake-build-*/
# The C++ test suite is documented as `cmake -S . -B build-tests` (CLAUDE.md,
# doc/), and side-by-side comparison trees (build-tests-toxav-green/-red, …)
# follow the same prefix. Without this they sit untracked at ~150 MB and can be
# swept into a commit by a `git add -A`.
build-tests*/

